WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.680
When was the last time brunch
gave you an actual break?

00:00:03.083 --> 00:00:05.652
Imagine walking in, putting the phone away

00:00:05.679 --> 00:00:08.949
and finding a seat where nobody
needs you to organize a thing.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:13.481
Mommy and Daddy Break Club brings
parents together around a slower morning.

00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:16.728
Depending on the edition,
that can mean gentle movement,

00:00:17.071 --> 00:00:20.175
coffee, brunch or a mimosa
with someone new.

00:00:20.435 --> 00:00:23.649
There is room to relax, connect,
and take a photo.

00:00:24.053 --> 00:00:27.294
Each invitation tells you what
is planned for that particular date.

00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:30.768
Behind the scenes,
VNV selects the catering,

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:34.298
décor, multimedia and staffing partners,

00:00:34.532 --> 00:00:37.417
and coordinates the logistics
that make the morning flow.

00:00:37.677 --> 00:00:40.768
Our producers bring experience
from more than two hundred

00:00:40.781 --> 00:00:44.751
and fifty small and midsize events,
alongside our corporate work.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.662
Join the free priority
list for invitations.

00:00:48.065 --> 00:00:52.351
When a date opens, you can see the details
and decide whether to book your places.
